    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but \"the moment\" feels so small and temporary. it feels like i'm just performing these little tasks, like working and eating and sleeping, just to pass the time until i die. if the end result is always zero, why go through the exhausting effort of trying to find \"joy\" in the meantime?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
